*> PLB-K003 commarea-without-length: a transaction program that uses
*> DFHCOMMAREA without ever testing EIBCALEN.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTVIEW.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-STATE.
    05  WS-ACCOUNT-ID       PIC X(11).
    05  WS-PAGE             PIC 9(3).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  DFHCOMMAREA.
    05  CA-ACCOUNT-ID       PIC X(11).
    05  CA-PAGE             PIC 9(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: the first use; the first time the transaction starts
    *> there is no COMMAREA.
    MOVE CA-ACCOUNT-ID TO WS-ACCOUNT-ID
    MOVE CA-PAGE TO WS-PAGE
    ADD 1 TO WS-PAGE
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('AVIW') COMMAREA(WS-STATE) END-EXEC.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTMENU.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-STATE                PIC X(14).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  DFHCOMMAREA             PIC X(14).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Fine: EIBCALEN is tested first.
    IF EIBCALEN = 0
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-STATE
    ELSE
        MOVE DFHCOMMAREA TO WS-STATE
    END-IF
    EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('AMNU') COMMAREA(WS-STATE) END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTMENU.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ACCTCALC.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01  DFHCOMMAREA.
    05  CA-AMOUNT           PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Fine: only LINKed to with a COMMAREA, so it always has one.
    ADD 1 TO CA-AMOUNT
    EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
END PROGRAM ACCTCALC.
END PROGRAM ACCTVIEW.
